<title>USA: Georgia-Pacific Corp Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Georgia-Pacific Corp Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary	     $ 1.09		   $ 3.57</p>
<p> Net			 99,000		  324,000</p>
<p> Revs		   3,446,000		3,705,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	90,600		   90,700</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary	    $  1.70		  $  9.12</p>
<p> Net			154,000		  821,000</p>
<p> Revs		   9,814,000	     10,882,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	90,500		   90,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except earnings per shr)</p>
<p>First Call mean estimate $0.55.</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding unusual gains, net income for the third quarter was $51 million, or $0.56 per share. Results included a $25 million, or $0.28 per share, after-tax gain and after-tax cash proceeds of $50 million resulting from the sale of two facilities. Results also included a $23 million, or $0.25 per share, after-tax gain related to settlement of pension obligations.</p>
</text>
